Practical 1 — Purchase + Freight
Transaction Details
Date: 10 August 2026
Supplier: Techno Supplies
Supplier Invoice No.: TS/145
Item Quantity Rate Amount
USB Keyboard 50 Nos. ₹800 ₹40,000
USB Mouse 50 Nos. ₹400 ₹20,000
Purchase Total ₹60,000
Freight: ₹3,000
GST: Not applicable
Steps
1. Open Purchase Voucher
Go to:
Gateway of Tally → Vouchers → F9 (Purchase)
Select Item Invoice mode.
2. Enter Voucher Details
 Date: 10-08-2026 
 Party A/c Name: Techno Supplies 
 Supplier Invoice No.: TS/145 
3. Create Supplier Ledger
If the ledger does not exist:  Ledger Name: Techno Supplies 
 Under: Sundry Creditors 
Save.
4. Create Purchase Ledger
 Ledger Name: Purchase – Computer Accessories 
 Under: Purchase Accounts 
Save.
Debit: Purchase – Computer Accessories
Credit: Techno Supplies
5. Create Stock Items
Create:
 USB Keyboard → Unit: Nos. 
 USB Mouse → Unit: Nos. 
6. Enter Purchase Details
Item Qty Rate
USB Keyboard 50 ₹800
USB Mouse 50 ₹400
Purchase value = ₹60,000
7. Add Freight in the SAME Purchase Voucher
Under Additional Cost of Purchase, select:
Freight Inward
If the ledger does not exist, create:  Ledger Name: Freight Inward 
 Under: Direct Expenses 
Enter:
₹3,000
8. Save the Voucher
Press Ctrl + A.
Result
Purchase = ₹60,000
Additional Cost = ₹3,000
Total Inventory Cost = ₹63,000
